5. Benefits of Modularization

Easy to Swap Services: Change the AI_PROVIDER environment variable to switch between OpenAI and another AI service.
Reusable Components: Each module (e.g., services, routes, utils) can be reused across projects.
Testability: Easier to write unit tests for individual components.
Scalability: Add new features or services without modifying existing code.
6. Example: Switching to Another AI Service

To switch to another AI service:

